|---|---|---|
| `normalize("NFD")` | — | Decomposes `é` → `e` + combining accent |
| `/[\u0300-\u036f]/g` | `replace` | Drops the now-detached combining marks |
| `.toLowerCase()` | — | Uniform case |
| `/&/g` → `" and "` | `replace` | Human-readable ampersand expansion |
| `/[^a-z0-9\s-]/g` | `replace` | Strips punctuation, symbols, etc. |
| `/[\s-]+/g` → `"-"` | `replace` | Collapses runs of spaces/hyphens |
| `/^-+\|-+$/g` | `replace` | Trims edge hyphens |

