## Key Design Decisions

| Concern | Decision |
|---|---|
| **Regex parsing** | Single regex captures all optional groups; avoids `new Date(str)` cross-browser quirks |
| **UTC-first** | `parseDate` always returns a UTC-normalised `Date`; offsets are subtracted |
| **Offset shifting** | `formatDate` with an offset shifts the UTC time *forward* before formatting, so the displayed wall-clock time is correct |
| **Millisecond padding** | `msStr.padEnd(3, "0")` handles `".1"` → 100 ms, `".12"` → 120 ms correctly |
| **Leap year / month-end** | `validateDateParts` uses `new Date(year, month, 0)` to find the true last day |
| **No dependencies** | Pure stdlib — no `date-fns`, `luxon`, or `moment` required |

