## Key Design Decisions

| Concern | Choice |
|---|---|
| **Regex validation** | Single regex captures all groups; field-level range checks follow |
| **Offset handling** | `formatDate` shifts the UTC epoch before reading digits; `parseDate` subtracts the offset to normalise to UTC |
| **Date-only strings** | Parsed as **midnight UTC** (matches ISO-8601 spec, avoids timezone-shift surprises) |
| **Milliseconds** | Truncated to 3 digits on parse; optional on format via `ms` flag |
| **Leap seconds** | Second field accepts `60` on parse |
| **No dependencies** | Pure JS — no `date-fns`, `luxon`, or `moment` needed |

