## Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| **Manual regex parsing** in `parseDate` | `new Date(str)` behaviour is inconsistent across engines for date-only strings (local vs UTC) |
| **UTC arithmetic** in `formatDate` | Avoids any DST or locale ambiguity |
| `offsetMinutes` option | Lets callers express any UTC offset without coupling to `Date`'s local timezone |
| `null` offset → bare datetime | Useful for storing in databases that handle timezone separately |
| Millisecond normalisation (`padEnd`) | Correctly handles `.1` → 100 ms, `.12` → 120 ms per ISO-8601 |

